## Costs and risks

- Vision-first delays the first case list; if the vision is vague, requirements inherit the error and the cases test the wrong thing (my #1: less reckoning loses; my #2: you can know victory but cannot make it).
- The loop has a rework price: every probe that changes a "fails if" casts doubt on the cases already attached (my #17; my #6).
